      "text": "A policy rule may specify its replacement text, and Python expands a backreference in it. A rule that captured an email and replaced it with the capture emitted the original address and counted one redaction. An audit trail asserting the data was masked, over data that was not, is worse than no redaction at all. That plus three more high-severity findings were all reproduced by execution and closed (#180).",
